# Environment overrides for the beacond.service unit.
#
# Sourced via EnvironmentFile=-/etc/sysconfig/beacond in beacond.service
# (the leading '-' there makes this file optional, so removing it is not a
# startup failure).
#
# beacond itself takes no environment variables today. BEACOND_OPTS is an
# operator extension point for passing extra command-line arguments to the
# daemon (e.g. an alternate -config path) without editing the packaged unit
# file or resorting to `systemctl edit`.
#
#BEACOND_OPTS=""
